---
/* Placed above the first affiliate link on a page — footer-only disclosure is
   not good enough, and the FTC guidance is that it must be hard to miss. */
---
<p class="aff">
  <strong>Heads up:</strong> some links below are affiliate links. If you buy through one we may
  earn a commission at no extra cost to you. It never affects the order of our recommendations —
  <a href="/gear/how-we-test/">here is how we actually rank things</a>.
</p>
<style>
  .aff {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--accent-soft); border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
    border-radius: var(--r-md); padding: var(--s-3) var(--s-4);
    margin-block: var(--s-5);
  }
  .aff strong { color: var(--text); }
</style>
